    "eyebrow": "First look",
    "heading": "The shape of the run",
    "html": [
     "<p>Left of the start, the visited part of the tape grows like the square root of the step count, the signature of a head sweeping back and forth across the whole tape and adding a cell or a few at the end of each sweep (a <em>bouncer</em>-like shape) (fitted exponent 0.535). Right of the start it grows like a power of the step count other than 1/2 (fitted exponent 0.124).</p>",
     "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 560 240\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"cells visited on each side against steps, log scales\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:560px;height:auto;font:11px var(--mono);\"><line x1=\"40.0\" x2=\"40.0\" y1=\"20.0\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"var(--line)\"/><text x=\"40.0\" y=\"216\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"var(--muted)\">2^4</text><line x1=\"116.8\" x2=\"116.8\" y1=\"20.0\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"var(--line)\"/><text x=\"116.8\" y=\"216\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"var(--muted)\">2^8</text><line x1=\"193.6\" x2=\"193.6\" y1=\"20.0\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"var(--line)\"/><text x=\"193.6\" y=\"216\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"var(--muted)\">2^12</text><line x1=\"270.4\" x2=\"270.4\" y1=\"20.0\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"var(--line)\"/><text x=\"270.4\" y=\"216\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"var(--muted)\">2^16</text><line x1=\"347.2\" x2=\"347.2\" y1=\"20.0\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"var(--line)\"/><text x=\"347.2\" y=\"216\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"var(--muted)\">2^20</text><line x1=\"424.0\" x2=\"424.0\" y1=\"20.0\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"var(--line)\"/><text x=\"424.0\" y=\"216\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"var(--muted)\">2^24</text><line x1=\"500.8\" x2=\"500.8\" y1=\"20.0\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"var(--line)\"/><text x=\"500.8\" y=\"216\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"var(--muted)\">2^28</text><line x1=\"40\" x2=\"520\" y1=\"200.0\" y2=\"200.0\" stroke=\"var(--line)\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"204.0\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"var(--muted)\">2^0</text><line x1=\"40\" x2=\"520\" y1=\"155.7\" y2=\"155.7\" stroke=\"var(--line)\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"159.7\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"var(--muted)\">2^4</text><line x1=\"40\" x2=\"520\" y1=\"111.5\" y2=\"111.5\" stroke=\"var(--line)\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"115.5\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"var(--muted)\">2^8</text><line x1=\"40\" x2=\"520\" y1=\"67.2\" y2=\"67.2\" stroke=\"var(--line)\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"71.2\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"var(--muted)\">2^12</text><path d=\"M40.0,177.9 L59.2,177.9 L78.4,168.9 L97.6,168.9 L116.8,163.2 L136.0,154.8 L155.2,153.0 L174.4,144.7 L193.6,143.2 L212.8,138.2 L232.0,129.5 L251.2,125.7 L270.4,118.1 L289.6,113.8 L308.8,112.3 L328.0,107.8 L347.2,100.6 L366.4,98.3 L385.6,89.1 L404.8,84.6 L424.0,82.6 L443.2,72.8 L462.4,69.3 L481.6,62.6 L500.8,58.5 L520.0,51.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M40.0,177.9 L59.2,171.4 L78.4,171.4 L97.6,166.8 L116.8,160.3 L136.0,160.3 L155.2,157.9 L174.4,155.7 L193.6,153.9 L212.8,150.7 L232.0,149.3 L251.2,146.8 L270.4,144.7 L289.6,142.8 L308.8,139.6 L328.0,138.2 L347.2,136.3 L366.4,132.6 L385.6,129.3 L404.8,128.2 L424.0,126.2 L443.2,124.4 L462.4,122.8 L481.6,121.3 L500.8,120.2 L520.0,119.4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--head)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"520\" y=\"24.0\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"var(--fg2)\"><tspan fill=\"var(--accent)\">&#9632; left of start</tspan>  <tspan fill=\"var(--head)\">&#9632; right of start</tspan>  (steps across, cells up)</text></svg>",
     "<p>After 10<sup>9</sup> steps the tape spans 14,386 cells (11,274 left of the start, 155 right), with a density of 1s of 1.0.</p>",
     "<p>The tape (run-length coded, <code>1^5</code> is five 1s, <code>C&gt;0</code> the head in state C on a 0) at some of the last moments the head reached a new cell, cut to 400 characters:</p><div style=\"overflow-x:auto\"><table class=\"tbl\"><thead><tr><th>side</th><th>step</th><th>tape</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>left</td><td>795,317,117</td><td><code>A&gt;0 1^5154 0^2 1^1659 0^2 1^4971 0^2 1^12</code></td></tr><tr><td>left</td><td>810,947,909</td><td><code>A&gt;0 1^4018 0^2 1^3363 0^2 1^4971 0^2 1^12</code></td></tr><tr><td>left</td><td>826,584,338</td><td><code>A&gt;0 1^2392 0^2 1^5802 0^2 1^4971 0^2 1^12</code></td></tr><tr><td>right</td><td>703,395,650</td><td><code>1^2943 0^3 1^8848 0 1 A&gt;0</code></td></tr><tr><td>right</td><td>762,155,230</td><td><code>1^5155 0 1 0^3 1^6636 0 1 A&gt;0</code></td></tr><tr><td>right</td><td>795,215,794</td><td><code>1^5155 0 1^1660 0 1 0^3 1^4977 0 1 A&gt;0</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
     "<p>These are measurements of one bounded run, sorted by <code>tools/py/bbtools/triage.py</code>; the macro structure behind them is the next thing to find.</p>"
