 "summary": "A few huge blocks of 1s. An exact event map is proved in Lean: an even block is split, a quarter to the left and three quarters to the right; an odd block at the left end is folded, 2 for 3. The machine halts iff the orbit of this map leaves the rules and stops; no halt in the first 10^137 steps (kernel), 10^13275 (compiled). Open.",
 "family": "Collatz-like: blocks split 1:3 by quarters",
 "decision": "open"
